{"name":"Marshmallow Cream","hex":"#f3e0d6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"marshmallow","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Marsh mallow, a species of mallow, Althaea officinalis, that grows in marshy terrain. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A type of confectionery, originally (since Ancient Egyptian times) made from this plant, but now generally made of sugar or corn syrup, gelatin that has been presoftened in water, gum arabic, flavorings, and sometimes beaten egg whites, all whipped to a spongy consistency."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To soften (literally or figuratively)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/marshmallow"},{"term":"cream","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The butterfat or milkfat part of milk which rises to the top; this part when separated from the remainder.","The liquid separated from milk, possibly with certain other milk products added, and with at least eighteen percent of it milkfat."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Cream-coloured; having a yellowish white colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cream"}],"entries":[{"title":"Marshmallow","blocks":[{"text":"Marshmallow is a confection made from sugar, water and gelatin whipped to a solid-but-soft consistency. It is used as a filling in baking or molded into shapes and coated with corn starch. This sugar confection is inspired by a medicinal confection made from Althaea officinalis, the marsh-mallow plant."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/White_Marshmallows.jpg/330px-White_Marshmallows.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshmallow","wikidata":"Q272198"},{"title":"Cream","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is a dairy product composed of the higher-fat layer skimmed from the top of milk before homogenization. The butterfat, which is less dense, rises to the top and is skimmed off, resulting in gravity cream. The industrial production of cream instead uses centrifugal separators to make separator cream. Cream is often sold in grades defined by their butterfat content. It contains high levels of saturated fat, in ascending proportion from light cream to heavy cream."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg/330px-01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream","wikidata":"Q13228"},{"title":"Cream (colour)","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is the color of the cream produced by cattle grazing on natural pasture with plants rich in yellow carotenoid pigments, some of which are incorporated into the fresh milk. This gives a yellow tone to otherwise-white milk at higher fat concentrations. Cream is the pastel colour of yellow, much as pink is to red. By mixing yellow and white, cream can be produced."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg/330px-Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream_(colour)","wikidata":"Q2730433"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG/500px-Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG/1280px-Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG/500px-Althaea_officinalis_002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The marsh-mallow plant (Althaea officinalis)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAlthaea_officinalis_002.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg/500px-Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg/1280px-Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg/500px-Just_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Just Born Peeps in an Easter basket","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJust_Born_Peeps_in_an_Easter_Basket.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Handmade_Marshmallows_by_FatMatt_%284774326832%29.jpg/500px-Handmade_Marshmallows_by_FatMatt_%284774326832%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Handmade_Marshmallows_by_FatMatt_%284774326832%29.jpg/1280px-Handmade_Marshmallows_by_FatMatt_%284774326832%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Handmade_Marshmallows_by_FatMatt_%284774326832%29.jpg/500px-Handmade_Marshmallows_by_FatMatt_%284774326832%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A freshly-cut batch of homemade marshmallows","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHandmade_Marshmallows_by_FatMatt_(4774326832).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/RoastingMarshmallow.jpg/120px-RoastingMarshmallow.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/RoastingMarshmallow.jpg/250px-RoastingMarshmallow.j